Node ID=1 halt
Text=Far enough. The captain said one might come up the road on their own feet, and that we were to take that one alive. The Scion. Are you it?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I am. Take me to your captain.
Go to node ID=10 steel
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Outwit 6 greater or equal
Reply Text=I am, and I was told to come as I am. Armed. She will want to see what I carry. Ask her, if you like.
Go to node ID=20 armed
Icon=Speach Skill Icon

